    <fr:title text="German Potato Salad › Instructions"><fr:link href="sss-0029.xml" title="German Potato Salad" addr="sss-0029" type="local">German Potato Salad</fr:link> › Instructions</fr:title>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <fr:ol><fr:li>Peel and cube potatoes.</fr:li>
<fr:li>Boil potatoes until fork tender, but still slightly firm.</fr:li>
<fr:li>Cook bacon, then crumble. Reserve bacon grease.</fr:li>
<fr:li>Dice onion and cook in bacon grease until brown.</fr:li>
<fr:li>Mix bacon, onion, potatoes, mayo, sour cream, cold water, 1 tbsp salt, 1 tbsp pepper, and sugar in an oven-safe bowl.</fr:li>
<fr:li>Bake for 60 minutes at 350 Fahrenheit. Broil for 5-7 minutes, or until golden brown.</fr:li></fr:ol>
  </fr:mainmatter>
