                <fr:title text="The Annoying Bit That I Wish Recipe Writers Put on the Bottom">The Annoying Bit That I Wish Recipe Writers Put on the Bottom</fr:title>
              </fr:frontmatter>
              <fr:mainmatter>
                <fr:p>This is another cherished recipe from my mother.</fr:p>
                <fr:p>As a child, I was extraordinarily averse to mayo, sour cream, cottage cheese, etc. I didn't understand how delicious this recipe was until I was about 20 or so. I can't believe I had missed out for so long.</fr:p>
